msgstr "Nie kręci się – złącze może być puste."

#. Translators: under a fan on the Fans page, its mode.
#: crates/app/src/fans/row.rs:87
msgctxt "fan state"
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Ręcznie"

#. Translators: under a fan on the Fans page while its duty
#. cycle rises to the one of its curve.
#: crates/app/src/fans/row.rs:93
msgid "Speeding up"
msgstr "Przyspiesza"

#. Translators: under a fan on the Fans page while its duty
